* CABSRT05 - SORT RATED DETAIL FOR BILL DETAIL BUILD
* MVT SORT/MERGE CONTROL CARD.  USED WHEN CABRAT10 IS RERUN
* STANDALONE - RESEQUENCES THE RATED CHAIN BY BAN, SECTION AND
* LINE BEFORE THE BUILD STEP, WHICH WALKS THE CHAIN IN THAT
* ORDER AND WILL NOT BACK UP.
*
* THE REFORMAT HAS LEFT THIS CARD.  THE RECORD IS REBUILT AS ITS
* LEADING 164 BYTES, A THREE BYTE ZONED FIELD AND ITS TRAILING
* 33 BYTES BY THE E35 EXIT CABSXRTY, WHICH AS PART OF THAT
* REBUILD ZEROES RT-RETRY-COUNT AT COLUMNS 165 THROUGH 167 ON
* EVERY RECORD THAT PASSES THROUGH.  NO CABRAT PROGRAM SETS THAT
* FIELD BACK, SO WITHOUT THE EXIT A RERUN CARRIES THE RETRY
* COUNT OF THE ATTEMPT THAT FAILED.
*
* EQUAL KEY HANDLING IS NOT CODED.  BAN, SECTION AND LINE ARE
* UNIQUE ON THE RATED CHAIN, SO THERE IS NO EQUAL KEY ORDER TO
* GUARANTEE.
*
* THE REFORMAT AND THE RESET ARE NO LONGER READABLE FROM THIS
* CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(9,13,CH,A,150,3,CH,A,153,4,CH,A)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(200)
 MODS E35=(CABSXRTY,4096,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
